📚 Project Title: BookNest – Where Stories Nestle

BookNest is a full-stack online bookstore application developed as part of my Smart Bridge Project.
This platform allows users to explore books, view details, and experience a seamless digital reading marketplace.

🚀 Key Features:
• User Authentication (Login & Signup)
• Browse and Search Books
• Add to Cart Functionality
• Responsive UI
• Secure Backend APIs

🛠 Tech Stack Used:
• Frontend: React.js, HTML, CSS, JavaScript
• Backend: Node.js, Express.js
• Database: MongoDB

🎯 Project Goal:
To build a scalable and user-friendly web application that enhances the online book purchasing experience.

